menu "OpenCharm"

config OPENCHARM_BENCH_FACE
    bool "Show the face without Wi-Fi or charmd (bench only)"
    default n
    help
        For checking the screen, the key, touch, the battery and the status screen on the bench
        without a network: the board doesn't start Wi-Fi and plays charmd's hello and "unlocked"
        to the core itself. Never on a charm someone uses.

config OPENCHARM_AUDIO_SELFTEST
    bool "Speaker, mic and echo cancellation self-test at boot (bench only)"
    default n
    help
        Plays a 1 kHz tone for a few seconds at boot and logs how loud the echo reference, the
        microphone and the echo-cancelled signal were. For checking the audio with nobody at
        the board. Never on a charm someone uses.

endmenu
